   "Proposal": "A. Blanket Wave-3 stations",
   "Evidence": "Wave-2 revenue covers 8.3\u00d7 fixed cost at commercial_hub sites but only 3.0\u00d7 at transit_hub; meanwhile 42% of failures sit at 20% of existing stations \u2014 capacity, not coverage, is the constraint",
