  {
   "Proposal": "B. More batteries (replace Kyron + 3W buffer)",
   "Evidence": "\u20b94.8 Cr replaces the retired fleet; converting ~60% of 11,624 monthly stockouts recovers \u20b90.07 Cr/yr of margin (direct payback ~884 months on margin alone); stockouts also carry the single largest churn odds-ratio (1.46)",
   "Verdict": "YES \u2014 first priority; pair with Gen-1 charger upgrades at hot hubs (91.8 vs 42.2 min charge)"
  },
  {
   "Proposal": "C. Network-wide peak pricing",
   "Evidence": "Pilot DiD shows peak share moved -2.5 pp \u2014 it's revenue, not load-shifting; surcharge-exempt B2B free-rode 116,116 peak swaps (\u20b917.4 L) in-pilot. Billable rollout \u2248 \u20b91.6 Cr/yr",
   "Verdict": "YES after closing the exemption + funding a real off-peak rebate"
  },
